web/public/models/head.glb and head.extra.glb are a Derivative Work of GNM Head
v3.0, modified by this project:
- 30 identity and 40 expression components converted to glTF morph targets, the
  mesh split into parts and compressed (pipeline/src/ftv_pipeline/export_glb.py);
- semantic "Shape" directions, weighted sums of GNM identity components solved by
  pipeline/src/ftv_pipeline/semantic.py;
- twelve emotions built from label means of GNM's ExpressionSampler
  (gnm/shape/semantic_sampler.py with expression_decoder_model.h5, same copyright,
  licence and commit), averaged over 1,024 samples per label by
  pipeline/tools/gnm_sampler and stored in pipeline/config/emotions.json, each split into upper- and lower-face targets.
The other generated data in web/src/data and web/public/textures is computed from
the same model by this project's pipeline.

The tongue animation meshes inside GNM were adapted by Google from work by
Salvador Medina, Copyright (c) 2022 Salvador Medina, MIT License (text included in
third_party/GNM/LICENSE).

